cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use AIEW/AUEC, please cite this software release and its technical report."
title: "AIEW/AUEC: Verifiable Hybrid AI Execution"
type: software
version: "0.35.0-prestandard"
date-released: "2026-08-04"
repository-code: "https://github.com/mohammedmessaoudene-cmd/AUEC"
abstract: >-
  A provider- and transport-neutral research pre-standard and reference
  runtime for bounded, verifiable hybrid execution between remote AI systems
  and host-controlled local agents. Licensing is assigned by path: CC-BY-4.0
  for specifications and narrative documentation, Apache-2.0 for separable
  interoperability material, and AGPL-3.0-only for the reference runtime.
